  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 160°C (325°F).",
    "Grease a 900g fondue pot or a 20cm springform pan with butter.",
    "Combine almond paste, dark chocolate chips, almond meal, and brown sugar in a large mixing bowl.",
    "Whisk in eggs and melted butter until smooth.",
    "Stir in vanilla extract and praline French candy.",
    "Pour batter into the prepared fondue pot or springform pan.",
    "Bake for 40 minutes or until the edges are golden brown and the center is set.",
    "Remove from oven and sprinkle with flaky sea salt.",
    "Let cool in the pan for 10 minutes before slicing and serving."
  ],
